"id":"five-grid-tiers--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":".xl:col-4"},{"id":"five-grid-tiers--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":".xl:col-4"},{"id":"five-grid-tiers--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":".xl:col-4"},{"id":"five-grid-tiers--paragraph-17","type":"paragraph","en":".2xl:col-4"},{"id":"five-grid-tiers--paragraph-18","type":"paragraph","en":".2xl:col-4"},{"id":"five-grid-tiers--paragraph-19","type":"paragraph","en":".2xl:col-4"},{"id":"three-equal-columns","type":"heading","en":"Three equal columns","level":2},{"id":"three-equal-columns--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Get three equal-width columns <strong>starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops</strong>. On mobile devices, tablets and below, the columns will automatically stack."},{"id":"three-equal-columns--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-4"},{"id":"three-equal-columns--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-4"},{"id":"three-equal-columns--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-4"},{"id":"three-equal-columns-alternative","type":"heading","en":"Three equal columns alternative","level":2},{"id":"three-equal-columns-alternative--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"By using the <code>.row-cols-*</code> classes, you can easily create a grid with equal columns."},{"id":"three-equal-columns-alternative--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> child of <code>.md:row-cols-3</code>"},{"id":"three-equal-columns-alternative--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> child of <code>.md:row-cols-3</code>"},{"id":"three-equal-columns-alternative--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> child of <code>.md:row-cols-3</code>"},{"id":"three-unequal-columns","type":"heading","en":"Three unequal columns","level":2},{"id":"three-unequal-columns--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Get three columns <strong>starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops</strong> of various widths. Remember, grid columns should add up to twelve for a single horizontal block. More than that, and columns start stacking no matter the viewport."},{"id":"three-unequal-columns--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-3"},{"id":"three-unequal-columns--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-6"},{"id":"three-unequal-columns--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-3"},{"id":"two-columns","type":"heading","en":"Two columns","level":2},{"id":"two-columns--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Get two columns <strong>starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops</strong>."},{"id":"two-columns--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-8"},{"id":"two-columns--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-4"},{"id":"full-width-single-column","type":"heading","en":"Full width, single column","level":2},{"id":"full-width-single-column--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"No grid classes are necessary for full-width elements."},{"id":"two-columns-with-two-nested-columns","type":"heading","en":"Two columns with two nested columns","level":2},{"id":"two-columns-with-two-nested-columns--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Per the documentation, nesting is easy—just put a row of columns within an existing column. This gives you two columns <strong>starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops</strong>, with another two (equal widths) within the larger column."},{"id":"two-columns-with-two-nested-columns--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"At mobile device sizes, tablets and down, these columns and their nested columns will stack."},{"id":"two-columns-with-two-nested-columns--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-8"},{"id":"two-columns-with-two-nested-columns--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-6"},{"id":"two-columns-with-two-nested-columns--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-6"},{"id":"two-columns-with-two-nested-columns--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-4"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop","type":"heading","en":"Mixed: mobile and desktop","level":2},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The Bootstrap v5 grid system has six tiers of classes: xs (extra small, this class infix is not used), sm (small), md (medium), lg (large), xl (x-large), and 2xl (xx-large). You can use nearly any combination of these classes to create more dynamic and flexible layouts."},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Each tier of classes scales up, meaning if you plan on setting the same widths for md, lg, xl and 2xl, you only need to specify md."},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":".md:col-8"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6 .md:col-4"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6 .md:col-4"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6 .md:col-4"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6 .md:col-4"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-and-desktop--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-tablet-and-desktop","type":"heading","en":"Mixed: mobile, tablet, and desktop","level":2},{"id":"mixed-mobile-tablet-and-desktop--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":".sm:col-6 .lg:col-8"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-tablet-and-desktop--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6 .lg:col-4"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-tablet-and-desktop--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6 .sm:col-4"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-tablet-and-desktop--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6 .sm:col-4"},{"id":"mixed-mobile-tablet-and-desktop--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":".col-6 .sm:col-4"},{"id":"gutters","type":"heading","en":"Gutters","level":2},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"With <code>.gx-*</code> classes, the horizontal gutters can be adjusted."},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the <code>.gy-*</code> classes to control the vertical gutters."},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"With <code>.g-*</code> classes, the gutters in both directions can be adjusted."},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-17","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-19","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-20","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters"},{"id":"gutters--paragraph-21","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters"},{"id":"containers","type":"heading","en":"Containers","level":2,"anchors":[]},{"id":"containers--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":".container"},{"id":"containers--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":".sm:container"},{"id":"containers--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":".md:container"},{"id":"containers--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":".lg:container"},{"id":"containers--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":".xl:container"},{"id":"containers--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":".2xl:container"},{"id":"containers--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":".container-fluid"}],"demos":[],"nav":[],"standalone":true,"embed":{"headStyles":"<style>.bd-placeholder-img{text-anchor:middle;user-select:none;font-size:1.125rem}@media (width>=768px){.bd-placeholder-img-lg{font-size:2.5rem}}.b-example-divider{background-color:#0000001a;border:1px solid #00000026;border-width:1px 0;width:100%;height:3rem;box-shadow:inset 0 .5em 1.5em #0000001a,inset 0 .125em .5em #00000026}.b-example-vr{flex-shrink:0;width:1.5rem;height:100vh}.bi{vertical-align:-.125em;fill:currentColor}.nav-scroller{z-index:2;height:2.75rem;position:relative;overflow-y:hidden}.nav-scroller .nav{text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;flex-wrap:nowrap;margin-top:-1px;padding-bottom:1rem;display:flex;overflow-x:auto}.bd-mode-toggle{z-index:1500}.bd-mode-toggle .bi{width:1em;height:1em}.bd-mode-toggle .menu .active .bi{display:block!important}\n</style>","body":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"d-none\"><symbol id=\"check2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M13.854 3.646a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708l-7 7a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-3.5-3.5a.5.5 0 1 1 .708-.708L6.5 10.293l6.646-6.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0z\"></path></symbol><symbol id=\"circle-half\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M8 15A7 7 0 1 0 8 1v14zm0 1A8 8 0 1 1 8 0a8 8 0 0 1 0 16z\"></path></symbol><symbol id=\"moon-stars-fill\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M6 .278a.768.768 0 0 1 .08.858 7.208 7.208 0 0 0-.878 3.46c0 4.021 3.278 7.277 7.318 7.277.527 0 1.04-.055 1.533-.16a.787.787 0 0 1 .81.316.733.733 0 0 1-.031.893A8.349 8.349 0 0 1 8.344 16C3.734 16 0 12.286 0 7.71 0 4.266 2.114 1.312 5.124.06A.752.752 0 0 1 6 .278z\"></path><path d=\"M10.794 3.148a.217.217 0 0 1 .412 0l.387 1.162c.173.518.579.924 1.097 1.097l1.162.387a.217.217 0 0 1 0 .412l-1.162.387a1.734 1.734 0 0 0-1.097 1.097l-.387 1.162a.217.217 0 0 1-.412 0l-.387-1.162A1.734 1.734 0 0 0 9.31 6.593l-1.162-.387a.217.217 0 0 1 0-.412l1.162-.387a1.734 1.734 0 0 0 1.097-1.097l.387-1.162zM13.863.099a.145.145 0 0 1 .274 0l.258.774c.115.346.386.617.732.732l.774.258a.145.145 0 0 1 0 .274l-.774.258a1.156 1.156 0 0 0-.732.732l-.258.774a.145.145 0 0 1-.274 0l-.258-.774a1.156 1.156 0 0 0-.732-.732l-.774-.258a.145.145 0 0 1 0-.274l.774-.258c.346-.115.617-.386.732-.732L13.863.1z\"></path></symbol><symbol id=\"sun-fill\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M8 12a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8zM8 0a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v2a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-2A.5.5 0 0 1 8 0zm0 13a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v2a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-2A.5.5 0 0 1 8 13zm8-5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5h-2a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h2a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5zM3 8a.5.5 0 0 1-.5.5h-2a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h2A.5.5 0 0 1 3 8zm10.657-5.657a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .707l-1.414 1.415a.5.5 0 1 1-.707-.708l1.414-1.414a.5.5 0 0 1 .707 0zm-9.193 9.193a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .707L3.05 13.657a.5.5 0 0 1-.707-.707l1.414-1.414a.5.5 0 0 1 .707 0zm9.193 2.121a.5.5 0 0 1-.707 0l-1.414-1.414a.5.5 0 0 1 .707-.707l1.414 1.414a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .707zM4.464 4.465a.5.5 0 0 1-.707 0L2.343 3.05a.5.5 0 1 1 .707-.707l1.414 1.414a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .708z\"></path></symbol></svg><div class=\"position-fixed bottom-0 end-0 mb-3 me-3 bd-mode-toggle\"><button class=\"btn btn-solid btn-icon theme-accent\" id=\"bd-theme\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-bs-toggle=\"menu\" data-bs-placement=\"top-end\" aria-label=\"Toggle theme (auto)\"><svg class=\"bi theme-icon-active\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#circle-half\"></use></svg><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Toggle theme</span></button><div class=\"menu border-keyline\" id=\"bd-theme-menu\" aria-labelledby=\"bd-theme\" style=\"--bs-menu-min-width: 8rem;\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu-item\" data-bs-theme-value=\"light\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg class=\"bi opacity-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#sun-fill\"></use></svg>Light<svg class=\"bi ms-auto d-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#check2\"></use></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu-item\" data-bs-theme-value=\"dark\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg class=\"bi opacity-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#moon-stars-fill\"></use></svg>Dark<svg class=\"bi ms-auto d-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#check2\"></use></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"menu-item active\" data-bs-theme-value=\"auto\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg class=\"bi opacity-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#circle-half\"></use></svg>Auto<svg class=\"bi ms-auto d-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#check2\"></use></svg></button></div></div><main><div class=\"container\"><h1>Bootstrap grid examples</h1><p class=\"fs-lg fw-light\">Basic grid layouts to get you familiar with building within the Bootstrap grid system.</p><p>In these examples the <code>.themed-grid-col</code> class is added to the columns to add some theming. This is not a class that is available in Bootstrap by default.</p><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Five grid tiers</h2><p>There are five tiers to the Bootstrap grid system, one for each range of devices we support. Each tier starts at a minimum viewport size and automatically applies to the larger devices unless overridden.</p><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-4</div><div class=\"col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-4</div><div class=\"col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-4</div></div><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"sm:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.sm:col-4</div><div class=\"sm:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.sm:col-4</div><div class=\"sm:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.sm:col-4</div></div><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-4</div><div class=\"md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-4</div><div class=\"md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-4</div></div><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"lg:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.lg:col-4</div><div class=\"lg:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.lg:col-4</div><div class=\"lg:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.lg:col-4</div></div><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"xl:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.xl:col-4</div><div class=\"xl:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.xl:col-4</div><div class=\"xl:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.xl:col-4</div></div><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"2xl:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.2xl:col-4</div><div class=\"2xl:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.2xl:col-4</div><div class=\"2xl:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.2xl:col-4</div></div><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Three equal columns</h2><p>Get three equal-width columns <strong>starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops</strong>. On mobile devices, tablets and below, the columns will automatically stack.</p><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-4</div><div class=\"md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-4</div><div class=\"md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-4</div></div><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Three equal columns alternative</h2><p>By using the <code>.row-cols-*</code> classes, you can easily create a grid with equal columns.</p><div class=\"row md:row-cols-3 mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> child of <code>.md:row-cols-3</code></div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> child of <code>.md:row-cols-3</code></div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> child of <code>.md:row-cols-3</code></div></div><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Three unequal columns</h2><p>Get three columns <strong>starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops</strong> of various widths. Remember, grid columns should add up to twelve for a single horizontal block. More than that, and columns start stacking no matter the viewport.</p><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"md:col-3 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-3</div><div class=\"md:col-6 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-6</div><div class=\"md:col-3 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-3</div></div><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Two columns</h2><p>Get two columns <strong>starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops</strong>.</p><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"md:col-8 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-8</div><div class=\"md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-4</div></div><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Full width, single column</h2><p class=\"fg-warning\">No grid classes are necessary for full-width elements.</p><hr class=\"my-4\"><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Two columns with two nested columns</h2><p>Per the documentation, nesting is easy—just put a row of columns within an existing column. This gives you two columns <strong>starting at desktops and scaling to large desktops</strong>, with another two (equal widths) within the larger column.</p><p>At mobile device sizes, tablets and down, these columns and their nested columns will stack.</p><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"md:col-8 themed-grid-col\"><div class=\"pb-3\">.md:col-8</div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"md:col-6 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-6</div><div class=\"md:col-6 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-6</div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-4</div></div><hr class=\"my-4\"><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Mixed: mobile and desktop</h2><p>The Bootstrap v5 grid system has six tiers of classes: xs (extra small, this class infix is not used), sm (small), md (medium), lg (large), xl (x-large), and 2xl (xx-large). You can use nearly any combination of these classes to create more dynamic and flexible layouts.</p><p>Each tier of classes scales up, meaning if you plan on setting the same widths for md, lg, xl and 2xl, you only need to specify md.</p><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"md:col-8 themed-grid-col\">.md:col-8</div><div class=\"col-6 md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-6 .md:col-4</div></div><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"col-6 md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-6 .md:col-4</div><div class=\"col-6 md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-6 .md:col-4</div><div class=\"col-6 md:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-6 .md:col-4</div></div><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"col-6 themed-grid-col\">.col-6</div><div class=\"col-6 themed-grid-col\">.col-6</div></div><hr class=\"my-4\"><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Mixed: mobile, tablet, and desktop</h2><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"sm:col-6 lg:col-8 themed-grid-col\">.sm:col-6 .lg:col-8</div><div class=\"col-6 lg:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-6 .lg:col-4</div></div><div class=\"row mb-3 text-center\"><div class=\"col-6 sm:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-6 .sm:col-4</div><div class=\"col-6 sm:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-6 .sm:col-4</div><div class=\"col-6 sm:col-4 themed-grid-col\">.col-6 .sm:col-4</div></div><hr class=\"my-4\"><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Gutters</h2><p>With <code>.gx-*</code> classes, the horizontal gutters can be adjusted.</p><div class=\"row row-cols-1 md:row-cols-3 gx-4 text-center\"><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gx-4</code> gutters</div></div><p class=\"mt-4\">Use the <code>.gy-*</code> classes to control the vertical gutters.</p><div class=\"row row-cols-1 md:row-cols-3 gy-4 text-center\"><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.gy-4</code> gutters</div></div><p class=\"mt-4\">With <code>.g-*</code> classes, the gutters in both directions can be adjusted.</p><div class=\"row row-cols-1 md:row-cols-3 g-3 text-center\"><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters</div><div class=\"col themed-grid-col\"><code>.col</code> with <code>.g-3</code> gutters</div></div></div><div class=\"container\" id=\"containers\"><hr class=\"my-4\"><h2 class=\"mt-4\">Containers</h2></div><div class=\"container themed-container text-center\">.container</div><div class=\"sm:container themed-container text-center\">.sm:container</div><div class=\"md:container themed-container text-center\">.md:container</div><div class=\"lg:container themed-container text-center\">.lg:container</div><div class=\"xl:container themed-container text-center\">.xl:container</div><div class=\"2xl:container themed-container text-center\">.2xl:container</div><div class=\"container-fluid themed-container text-center\">.container-fluid</div></main><script type=\"module\" src=\"/docs/6.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\"></script>","classes":"py-4","dir":"ltr"},"publishedAssets":[],"sourceScripts":["https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/assets/js/color-modes.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"],"sourceStyles":["https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/examples/grid/grid.css"]}
